        <description>Extract the Net Profit (after all expenses) for the financial year.

This field may appear under any of these labels:
- Net Profit, Nett Profit, Net Profit After Tax
- Net Profit before Vehicle Rent (use this if final net profit not available)
- Profit for the Year, Profit After Tax (PAT)
- Net Income, Bottom Line
- Current Period profit (in Balance Sheet P&amp;L section)
- Net Profit as per Profit &amp; Loss Account

Rules:
- This should be AFTER all expenses including depreciation and interest
- If both "before tax" and "after tax" figures exist, return AFTER TAX figure
- In proprietorship/partnership firms, tax is personal — net profit shown is usually pre-personal-tax
- Return plain number only. If not found, return: NA</description>
